{"unit_id":"chimneyQ__dsh-model-rotator#card-zh","repo":"chimneyQ/dsh-model-rotator","commit":"28a5953d2da9d8bea6f7d394d650b2a5b3415db8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-rotator 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的模型自动排序与故障转移插件。它接入 LLM 流处理，在当前模型尚未输出正文而请求失败时，按实测连通率、速度和冷却状态尝试其他已配置模型。它提供同模型重试、按失败类型冷却、切换确认、模型列表和渠道控制，以及设置页。状态、测速和置顶工具用于管理候选顺序。适合配置了多个模型渠道、希望单轮请求在模型故障时继续完成的用户；使用现有模型服务，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1689-1722","index.js:2336-2365","index.js:2945-2952","index.js:3048-3063","client.js:1317-1318"]}
{"unit_id":"chimneyQ__dsh-model-rotator#card-en","repo":"chimneyQ/dsh-model-rotator","commit":"28a5953d2da9d8bea6f7d394d650b2a5b3415db8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-rotator ranks models for the DeepSeek Harness web client. After a failure before reply text, it retries or switches using measured reliability, speed, and cooldown. Its web page shows model status and provider controls; tools report status, benchmark models, and pin a preference.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1689-1722","index.js:2336-2365","index.js:2945-2952","index.js:3048-3063","client.js:1317-1318"]}
